#. from yeager:scummvm
msgid "Use a more neutral color palette that closely emulates the NES Classic"
msgstr "Använd en mer neutral färgpalett som nära emulerar NES Classic"

#. from yeager:scummvm
msgid "Trim FM-TOWNS games to 200 pixels height"
